# Skill Repo Development Rule

This repository is dedicated to developing Agent skills.

## Scope And Location

- Place every production skill under `/skills`.
- Do not create new skill deliverables outside `/skills` unless explicitly requested.

## Identify Target Skill First

- Before making edits, identify exactly which skill is being developed.
- Confirm the target skill name and path first, especially when multiple skills exist.
- Keep changes focused on the target skill and avoid cross-skill drift.

## Required Development Workflow

- When developing or updating any skill, always use skill-development helpers first.
- Prioritize `create-skill` and `skill-development` related skills to guide structure and quality.

## Concrete Examples

- Good: "Target skill = `skills/release-notes`; all edits stay in that folder."
- Good: "Use `create-skill` guidance before drafting `SKILL.md` sections."
- Bad: "Start editing files without confirming which skill is in scope."
